# Prettier is not wired into this repo's scripts (see package.json), so
# `pnpm format` is not currently a risk. This file is cheap insurance
# against a VS Code format-on-save extension instead: Prettier reformats
# YAML frontmatter by collapsing indentation (e.g. `left:\ntitle:` instead
# of `left:\n  title:`), which silently breaks Slidev's nested keys
# (stats:, events:, left:/right:, steps:) with no error at build time.
slides.md
